      "content": "Your courage to speak against corruption, even at a personal cost, defines you by doing what others failed to, not by their current approval. The truth often takes time to surface, and your resilience in the face of betrayal will eventually be seen as a testament to your integrity. Give it another small attempt, perhaps smaller one, because a world that loses its decent people is a world worth building.",
